Thai DRG and TCMC material
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The Thai DRG classification, its books and its grouper tables are the work of the
Thai Casemix Centre (TCMC, สำนักพัฒนากลุ่มโรคร่วมไทย), https://www.tcmc.or.th

This repository does NOT contain any TCMC file. "npm run setup" downloads them from
the TCMC web site on your own machine:

  S0021.zip  grouper TGrp6305 (Thai DRG 6.3.4); only the tables c63i10.dbf,
             c63proc.dbf, c63drg.dbf and c63ccex.dbf are taken from it
  S0062.zip  Thai DRG Version 6.3.3, Volume 1 and Volume 2
  S0063.zip  Thai DRG Version 6.3.3, Appendix F

The grouping logic in src/native/ and the parser in tools/build-rules.mjs were written
from the published books. The order of the disease clusters in
groupers/6.3.4/native/flow.json was read from the MDC diagrams in Volume 2.

TGrp6305.exe was not decompiled, disassembled or otherwise reverse engineered. It was
used only as a black box (cases in, results out) to compare results
(tools/compare.mjs). It is not part of this repository.

The Apache License covers the code of this repository only. It gives no right to the
TCMC material: follow TCMC's own terms for the tables and books, and for any image or
file that contains them (for example a Docker image built from this repository).

This project is not made, checked or endorsed by TCMC. Check its results against the
official TCMC grouper before using them for reimbursement.
